OL,3,GNEWSAParents have 'more hope' after
OL,4,ACyprus death debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe parents of a man who was stabbed to
OL,7,Fdeath on holiday in Cyprus in 2016 say
OL,8,Fthey have "more hope" of seeing justice
OL,9,Fafter his case was raised in an
OL,10,F"emotional" debate in parliament.
OL,12,FTwo men suspected of being involved in
OL,13,Fthe attack on George Low, 22, fled to
OL,14,Fthe Turkish-controlled north of the
OL,15,Fisland. International arrest warrants
OL,16,Fwere issued but Cyprus Police has said
OL,17,Fthe case had not progressed.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
